        "revision_language_supported": true,
        "excerpts": [
          "NFLX Form 8-K Item 2.02, filed 2026-07-16 EX-99.1 2 ex991_q226.htm EX-99.1 Document Exhibit 99.1 July 16, 2026 Fellow shareholders, • Our financial performance remains solid and we’re on track to meet our objectives for the year: ◦ Q2 revenue grew 13% year over year (+12% on a FX-neutral basis 1 ) to $12.6B, and operating margin was 33%.",
          "Assumes foreign exchange rates remained constant with foreign exchange rates from each of the corresponding months of the prior-year period. 1 Q2 Results and Forecast Q2 revenue of $12.6B was in-line with forecast and grew 13% year over year (+12% on a foreign exchange (F/X) neutral basis), driven primarily by membership growth, pricing and increased ad revenue.",
          "As we noted in previous letters, operating income in Q2 grew slower than revenue because our content amortization growth is higher in the first half of the year; we continue to expect content amortization to grow slower in the second half of the year and to increase ~10% for 2026.",
          "For Q3, we expect revenue growth of 12% (or 11% F/X neutral) driven by growth in memberships, pricing, and ad revenue.",
          "Our 2026 outlook is consistent with our prior forecast: we are narrowing our revenue forecast to $51.0-$51.4B, which represents 13%-14% growth (~12% F/X neutral), driven by growth in memberships and pricing, and a projected rough doubling of our ads revenue to approximately $3 billion.",
          "Our forecast implies annual operating income growth of 20%+ for 2026.",
          "We work every day to raise the bar on our core series and film offering, which we have successfully done since we launched streaming in 2007.",
          "And Netflix Playground, our app for kids games, has experienced 3x growth in daily players since its launch in April, and has fueled growth in our kids mobile games engagement, which is up 600% year over year 9 .",
          "We are increasingly leveraging these tools to deliver higher quality output more quickly and at a lower cost than traditional methods.",
          "YTD 2026 As Reported Revenue $ 24,809,695 Operating Expenses 16,660,088 Operating Profit $ 8,149,607 Operating Margin 32.8 % FX Impact Revenue $ 87,127 Operating Expenses 20,139 Operating Profit $ 66,988 Adjusted* Revenue $ 24,722,568 Operating Expenses 16,639,949 Operating Profit $ 8,082,619 Operating Margin 32.7 % * Based on F/X rates at the beginning of each year including our F/X hedges at that time."
        ]
      },
